WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Step 1: Ask an intelligence-settings manager to check the selected company’s saved key, enablement, budget and request cap.

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:12.500
Step 2: Check the provider account has API billing and access to the configured model.

3
